{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cute fantasy raising simulation. You are Niziiro Mao, a happy-go-lucky Ink Mage who happens to be working as a maid in the royal palace. Her majesty doesn't seem to mind if you slack off, but it feels like she's expecting a lot from you nonetheless.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Walk around,  meet new people, have adventures, and collect spell cards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552520/extras/e703d5b5157926aa4c9275daff402e2d.avif?t=1758934129\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If things get too stressful, take a walk, eat something delicious, or have a nice nap to keep yourself rested.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552520/extras/90ba0e367a86fdfe064524dc9d6b7fa4.avif?t=1758934129\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Her majesty has a considerably laissez-faire approach to education, so you are free to make your own schedule. However, although her backing means you can try any job or class you'd like, you still need to work hard yourself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552520/extras/7edb3056c1849e04fa1a20dd72744683.poster.avif?t=1758934129\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552520/extras/7edb3056c1849e04fa1a20dd72744683.webm?t=1758934129\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552520/extras/7edb3056c1849e04fa1a20dd72744683.mp4?t=1758934129\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A slight painting accident. Sadly, you don't get paid for unsuccessful work.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Featuring:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552520/extras/720e71b61bd71296c692f79d13e8f8f3.avif?t=1758934129\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deck building and card game combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552520/extras/0ec544f83530ac2d2704447de4166771.avif?t=1758934129\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A talent tree to choose exactly how you want to grow up.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552520/extras/7ede5b09c1165d4f0de8e4e01de120ec.avif?t=1758934129\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hat based political hierarchy.<br><br>It's the first day of the year, you had a fun birthday party yesterday, and there's a knock on your door.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552520/extras/30293ff85412746b48e673a722e855d2.avif?t=1758934129\" data-has-big width=800 height=1000 /></span>Currently in development for PC and Android.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3552520?t=1758934129","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3552520?t=1758934129","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552520/f96ba65236153b64fc498c815d5e1a96268f6294/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758934129","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552520/f96ba65236153b64fc498c815d5e1a96268f6294/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758934129","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3637780,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cute fantasy raising simulation. You are Niziiro Mao, a happy-go-lucky Ink Mage who happens to be working as a maid in the royal palace. Her majesty doesn't seem to mind if you slack off, but it feels like she's expecting a lot from you nonetheless.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Walk around,  meet new people, have adventures, and collect spell cards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552520/extras/e703d5b5157926aa4c9275daff402e2d.avif?t=1758934129\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If things get too stressful, take a walk, eat something delicious, or have a nice nap to keep yourself rested.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552520/extras/90ba0e367a86fdfe064524dc9d6b7fa4.avif?t=1758934129\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Her majesty has a considerably laissez-faire approach to education, so you are free to make your own schedule. However, although her backing means you can try any job or class you'd like, you still need to work hard yourself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552520/extras/7edb3056c1849e04fa1a20dd72744683.poster.avif?t=1758934129\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552520/extras/7edb3056c1849e04fa1a20dd72744683.webm?t=1758934129\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552520/extras/7edb3056c1849e04fa1a20dd72744683.mp4?t=1758934129\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A slight painting accident. Sadly, you don't get paid for unsuccessful work.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Featuring:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552520/extras/720e71b61bd71296c692f79d13e8f8f3.avif?t=1758934129\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deck building and card game combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552520/extras/0ec544f83530ac2d2704447de4166771.avif?t=1758934129\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A talent tree to choose exactly how you want to grow up.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552520/extras/7ede5b09c1165d4f0de8e4e01de120ec.avif?t=1758934129\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hat based political hierarchy.<br><br>It's the first day of the year, you had a fun birthday party yesterday, and there's a knock on your door.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552520/extras/30293ff85412746b48e673a722e855d2.avif?t=1758934129\" data-has-big width=800 height=1000 /></span>Currently in development for PC and Android.</p>","developers":["Sleepy Cat Software"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552520/8d876c4b1db6096b43e73c8ff6d6ea25c154e378/header.jpg?t=1758934129","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3552520/1903897707/ada5c72eb9495a43686a088ff457528094c5f0dd/1758172380/dash_av1.mpd?t=1758934125","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3552520/1903897707/ada5c72eb9495a43686a088ff457528094c5f0dd/1758172380/dash_h264.mpd?t=1758934125","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3552520/1903897707/ada5c72eb9495a43686a088ff457528094c5f0dd/1758172380/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1758934125","id":257200792,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257200792/movie480.mp4?t=1758934125","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257200792/movie_max.mp4?t=1758934125"},"name":"Gameplay Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257200792/0b78409749e8e4e9b2f81dbbe436ea989382e3e9/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1758934125","webm":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257200792/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1758934125","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257200792/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1758934125"}}],"name":"Raising Niziiro: Albion's Witch"